{"CommitteeCode":"S31","FullName":"Senate Committee on Bills in the Third Reading","ShortName":"Bills in the Third Reading (S)","Description":"It shall be the duty of the committee on Bills in the Third Reading to consider all bills and resolves prior to their final reading, and examine, correct and recommend such amendments as may be necessary concerning duplication, grammatical errors, and constitutionality. The committee shall also consider all amendments subsequent to third reading and all amendments from the House. The committee shall also act in relation to all resolutions and proposals, and act on any other matters referred thereto.","Branch":"Senate","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"SenateChairperson":{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"MemberCode":"SND0","Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SND0"},"HouseChairperson":null,"DocumentsBeforeCommittee":[{"BillNumber":"H3712","DocketNumber":"HD4137","Title":"An Act to establish a sick leave bank for Kathleen Donnellan, an employee of the Norfolk Superior Court","PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T11:27:39.6433333"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"T_C1","Name":"Tackey Chan","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/T_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T11:27:39.6433333"},{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T11:46:15.6766667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"PMO","Name":"Patrick M. O'Connor","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PMO","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T11:27:39.6433333"},"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3712","IsDocketBookOnly":false},{"BillNumber":"H3771","DocketNumber":null,"Title":"An Act establish